  {
    "hotel_id": "1166152",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/ayaka-suites/hotel/jakarta-id.html",
    "name": "Ayaka Suites",
    "detail": "Hectic weekdays in Jakarta deserve a tranquil weekend getaway, and Ayaka Suites is the perfect place for it. The location is in the heart of Jakarta, but the hotel remains comfort and free from noise. Lotte Shopping Avenue is within walking distance, or if you feel like having local food, street vendors are everywhere within 500m radius. There is also a small pool next to the restaurant - not an Olympic standard one but pretty decent for little swimming with our children. It has gym facilities too, but I didn't have the time to try. Staffs are excellent, they paid extra attention to our children when we had our breakfast. Will definitely recommend and come back to this hotel whenever I feel like escaping from the crazy Jakarta!",
